# .rig-debug-scan-exclude
#
# Glob patterns for paths that should be excluded from debug artifact scanning.
# One pattern per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Uses shell glob syntax (e.g. vendor/**, templates/project/.husky/*).
#
# Add paths here when the pre-commit debug scanner produces false positives —
# for example, template files that define the very patterns being scanned for,
# or vendor directories that contain legitimate uses of debug APIs.

# Template hook files contain debug pattern definitions as string literals
templates/project/.husky/*
